  "sourceTitle": "I audited 443 GGUF quants across 25 repos. 64 of them can't be the quant their filename claims.",
  "sourceBodyHash": "2ee89ff985e4cb902f5cd4bf49e23e36d511bf46ecdd8535d85f071d14412c93",
